# Guard: the /graphify skill writes graphify-out/ relative to cwd, so a run from the
# repo root lands here instead of the tracked dir. See _architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md — run it as
# `cd _architecture/graphify && /graphify ../..` so output converges.
/graphify-out/
# Absolute machine-local paths the skill writes (SKILL.md:120, :122) — must not be committed.
_architecture/graphify/graphify-out/.graphify_python
_architecture/graphify/graphify-out/.graphify_root
_architecture/graphify/graphify-out/cache/ast/
_architecture/graphify/graphify-out/cache/stat-index.json
_architecture/graphify/graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
